{"id":"c55a65d7df5b6430","group":"89","path":"89/89-thm-glsb-truth-completeness.md","title":"Truth Completeness and Decidability of GLSB","display":"thm-glsb-truth-completeness — Truth Completeness and Decidability of GLSB","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"The Logic of Provability","book_abbrev":"89","label":"89-thm-glsb-truth-completeness","aliases":["89-thm-glsb-truth-completeness"],"display":"thm-glsb-truth-completeness — Truth Completeness and Decidability of GLSB","depends_on":["[[89-df-glsb-logic]]","[[89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness]]","[[89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization]]"],"created":"2026-10-05","revised":"2026-10-05"},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"The Logic of Provability"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"89"},{"key":"label","html":"89-thm-glsb-truth-completeness"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>89-thm-glsb-truth-completeness</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-glsb-truth-completeness — Truth Completeness and Decidability of GLSB"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"d60c56f59d86adad\" href=\"?note=d60c56f59d86adad\" title=\"89-df-glsb-logic\">89-df-glsb-logic</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"90426ebd1dd924ef\" href=\"?note=90426ebd1dd924ef\" title=\"89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness\">89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"0fcc108fa2ae7636\" href=\"?note=0fcc108fa2ae7636\" title=\"89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization\">89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization</a></span></div>"},{"key":"created","html":"2026-10-05"},{"key":"revised","html":"2026-10-05"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span>，标准 PA 可靠。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\\)</span> 为所有从命题字母集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Prop}\">\\(\\mathrm{Prop}\\)</span> 到 PA 句子集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\">\\(\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}\\)</span> 的赋值；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau^B_r\">\\(\\tau^B_r\\)</span> 为赋值 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"r\">\\(r\\)</span> 诱导的双模态算术翻译。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A^{sB}\">\\(A^{sB}\\)</span> 对每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"C\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A)\">\\(C\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A)\\)</span> 和每个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in\\{0,1\\}\">\\(i\\in\\{0,1\\}\\)</span> 收集 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\Box_iC\\to C\">\\(\\Box_iC\\to C\\)</span>，按语法码及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\">\\(i\\)</span> 的词典顺序折叠成合取后蕴含 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\">\\(A\\)</span>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Sub}_B\">\\(\\mathrm{Sub}_B\\)</span> 为双模态子公式树集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{GLB},\\mathrm{GLSB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\">\\(\\mathrm{GLB},\\mathrm{GLSB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\)</span> 为上述两种双模态定理集。</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Comp}(d)\">\\(\\operatorname{Comp}(d)\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span> 在有效双模态树编码下由一个普通总程序计算。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glsb\\text{-}truth\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLSB}\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow A^{sB}\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall r\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\\ (\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^B_r(A)),\\\\\n&amp;\\exists d_B,d_S:\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{Comp}(d_B)\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(d_S)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}(d_B(A)=1\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GLB})\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}(d_S(A)=1\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GLSB})\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glsb\\text{-}truth\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLSB}\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow A^{sB}\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\\\\n&amp;\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall r\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\\ (\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^B_r(A)),\\\\\n&amp;\\exists d_B,d_S:\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{Comp}(d_B)\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(d_S)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}(d_B(A)=1\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GLB})\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}(d_S(A)=1\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GLSB})\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>来源：Boolos, <em>The Logic of Provability</em>，第 15 章，印刷页 193–205,205–207；PDF 页码为印刷页加 39。本条采用本目录的等价语法约定。\n原书的双模态完全性与判定结果。GLB 的判定经辅助有限模型系统给出；GLSB 再经有限反射伴随式化约。这里引用判定性的来源证明，没有给 GLB 强加单模态的 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}(A)|}\">\\(2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}(A)|}\\)</span> 搜索界。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"89-df-glsb-logic","status":"resolved","id":"d60c56f59d86adad","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-glsb-logic]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness","status":"resolved","id":"90426ebd1dd924ef","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness]]","embed":false},{"target":"89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization","status":"resolved","id":"0fcc108fa2ae7636","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Prop}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\tau^B_r","display":false},{"tex":"r","display":false},{"tex":"A^{sB}","display":false},{"tex":"C\\in\\mathrm{Sub}_B(A)","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in\\{0,1\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\Box_iC\\to C","display":false},{"tex":"i","display":false},{"tex":"A","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{Sub}_B","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{GLB},\\mathrm{GLSB}\\subseteq\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{Comp}(d)","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}glsb\\text{-}truth\\text{-}completeness}\\vdash\n\\begin{aligned}\nA\\in\\mathrm{GLSB}\n&\\Longleftrightarrow A^{sB}\\in\\mathrm{GLB}\\\\\n&\\Longleftrightarrow\\forall r\\in\\mathrm{Sent}_{\\mathrm{PA}}^{\\mathrm{Prop}}\\ (\\mathbb N\\models\\tau^B_r(A)),\\\\\n&\\exists d_B,d_S:\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}\\to\\{0,1\\}\\ \\bigl[\\operatorname{Comp}(d_B)\\land\\operatorname{Comp}(d_S)\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}(d_B(A)=1\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GLB})\n\\land\\forall A\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{0,1}(d_S(A)=1\\leftrightarrow A\\in\\mathrm{GLSB})\\bigr].\n\\end{aligned}","display":true},{"tex":"2^{|\\mathrm{Sub}(A)|}","display":false}],"bytes":2157,"backlinks":[{"id":"05a599f85e508061","anchor":"ref-68","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[89-df-glsb-logic]]、[[89-thm-glsb-truth-completeness]]"},{"id":"e0c421a5b45aeb77","anchor":"ref-160","locations":["正文"],"count":2,"excerpt":"[[89-df-omega-consistency]] → [[89-df-omega-provability]] → [[89-df-bimodal-formula]] → [[89-df-glb-logic]] → [[89-df-bimodal-arithmetical-realization]] → [[89-thm-glb-arithmetical-completeness]] → [[89-thm-glb-kripke-incomplete]] → [[89-df-glsb-logic]] → [[89-thm-glsb-truth-completeness]]"}],"outgoing":["d60c56f59d86adad","90426ebd1dd924ef","0fcc108fa2ae7636"]}